# AzitWateringRecycleCan (35600), the Rainbow Springs sweeper, a civilian. Talked to, it says
# NpcString 1010639 and releases the client (the talk's leading ActionFailed, its line, the
# release). It looks for ground items as it appears, before the ground lines are laid, and then
# every 30 s within 450 of it, asking to pick each one up: the letter 160 away at the first look,
# the Zariche 600 away only once the sweeper has walked to the letter. Picking the Zariche up, it
# shouts NpcString 1800023 before the weapon leaves the world and ends its life; the letter it
# picks up silently. Its pick-up weights and its departure 5 minutes after it appears are in
# tests/ai/hall_watering_test.go, as the format renders no civilian's desires.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringRecycleCan
item 8035
npc can 35600 Folk 40 0 0 walks
ground letter 8035 1 200 0 0
ground zariche 8190 1 640 0 0 cursed

action can
action can
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcSay obj=can type=0 npc=1035600 text="Grarr! For the next 2 minutes or so, the game arena are will be cleaned. Throw any items you don't need to the floor now."
  S ActionFailed
advance 30s
tick x2
walk can
tick
  S DeleteObject obj=letter
advance 30s
tick x2
walk can
tick
  S NpcSay obj=can type=0 npc=1035600 text="It's a weapon surrounded by an ominous aura. I'll discard it because it may be dangerous. Miss...!"
  S DeleteObject obj=zariche
  S SystemMessage id=1818 3:8190
